## FE/BE → automation sync flow (summary)

```
Provided BDD file (Excel) ──┐
                            ├──→ Locators → Page objects → Tests → Execute & pass
FE/BE code ─────────────────┘              ↑___________________________|
```

- **Before automation:** Locate the provided BDD file; read BDD rows + FE/BE; confirm each step maps to real UI.
- **Before FE/BE merge:** Check provided BDD + pages/tests coverage; markup changes require same-task automation sync.
- **Never:** Edit/create the BDD file; hardcode a BDD filename; write tests/locators from assumptions; skip test execution.
- **On failure:** Inspect FE first; align locators/tests with BDD + FE — or fix FE markup. Report BDD/FE gaps.

